msgstr "A talisman as Lenain describes the genii's, the genius's verse written round it (<0>La Science cabalistique</0>, <1>p. 45</1>), lettered like the talisman on his <2>title page</2>. The name inside, in Hebrew as Lenain prints it, follows Mathers's <3>Key of Solomon</3> (1889), <4>Plate IV, Fig. 21</4>. Ours: Lenain says the verses are in Hebrew, and we letter his Latin; he draws no genius's talisman; and the sigil inside is the Golden Dawn's."

